From 935b9e495604adbcd26d32a61e8f17c8b23e5ea1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 10:21:34 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Web preview for marketing recordings: the real screens in
 a browser at phone size

Branch only, never main. Adds react-native-web, react-dom and @expo/metro-runtime, and
the smallest web-only changes for `expo export --platform web` to build and render:
a web resolver in metro.config.js (Uniwind 1.11's missing InputAccessoryView, and a web
entry that loads Skia's CanvasKit first), offline.web.ts in place of expo-sqlite, and no
anonymous sign-in on web. scripts/web-preview.sh builds and serves it with /api passed
through to the real API. The iOS bundle is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EFXvs3f7YjmQkfWVrLdj8m
